# 4️⃣ Customer Demographics Analysis

Customer demographics were analysed using:

* Age groups
* Gender

## 👥 Customer Age Groups

Age groups were created to make customer behaviour easier to compare.

```python
bins = [0, 18, 25, 35, 45, 55, 65, 100]

labels = [
    "0-18",
    "19-25",
    "26-35",
    "36-45",
    "46-55",
    "56-65",
    "65+"
]

df["Age Group"] = pd.cut(
    df["Age"],
    bins=bins,
    labels=labels
)

age_counts = df["Age Group"].value_counts().sort_index()

plt.figure(figsize=(10, 5))
age_counts.plot(kind="bar")

plt.title("Customer Age Group Distribution")
plt.xlabel("Age Group")
plt.ylabel("Number of Customers")

plt.show()
```

### 🔎 Observation

The age-group distribution identifies which customer segments contribute most to the dataset and helps businesses target marketing campaigns more effectively.

