# 5️⃣ Product Analysis

Product performance was analysed using:

* Top 10 best-selling products
* Revenue by product category

## 🏆 Top 10 Best-Selling Products

```python
top_products = (
    df.groupby("Product Category")["Quantity"]
    .sum()
    .sort_values(ascending=False)
    .head(10)
)

plt.figure(figsize=(10, 6))
top_products.sort_values().plot(kind="barh")

plt.title("Top 10 Best-Selling Products")
plt.xlabel("Quantity Sold")
plt.ylabel("Product")

plt.show()
```

### 🔎 Observation

The top-selling products represent the products with the highest sales volume. These products can be prioritised for inventory planning and promotional campaigns.

> **Note:** If your dataset contains a separate `Product` column, use `Product` instead of `Product Category` in the grouping.

---

## 💰 Revenue by Product Category

```python
category_revenue = (
    df.groupby("Product Category")["Total Amount"]
