# 7️⃣ 💡 Additional Non-Obvious Insight

An additional analysis was performed to identify a business insight that is not immediately visible from basic sales totals.

### Example: Sales by Age Group and Gender

```python
age_gender_sales = (
    df.groupby(["Age Group", "Gender"])["Total Amount"]
    .sum()
    .unstack()
)

age_gender_sales.plot(
    kind="bar",
    figsize=(12, 6)
)

plt.title("Sales by Age Group and Gender")
plt.xlabel("Age Group")
plt.ylabel("Total Sales")
plt.xticks(rotation=45)

plt.show()
```

### 🔎 Observation

This analysis can reveal whether particular age and gender segments generate disproportionately high sales.

For example, if one age group consistently generates higher revenue than other groups, the business could create targeted promotions for that customer segment.

